<title>SPAIN: BCH to sell its 8 pct stake in BAMI.</title>
<headline>BCH to sell its 8 pct stake in BAMI.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Banco Central Hispano is selling its eight percent stake in real estate group Bami, S.A. Inmobiliaria de Construcciones y Terrenos, the Stock Market Commission CNMV said on Thursday.</p>
<p>BCH has an eight percent stake, or 831,589 shares in the group. The sale price will be 301.75 pesetas a share, the CNMV said.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
